	(3578, 1, '2025-07-23 06:23:54', '2025-07-23 06:23:54', '<p>In this lesson, you\'ll learn the core building blocks of JavaScript, including variables, data types, operators, and how to write your first script. We\'ll also cover how JavaScript integrates with HTML to bring interactivity to web pages. By the end of this lesson, you\'ll have a solid foundation to start writing basic JavaScript code on your own.</p>', 'Example of Lesson Text with video.', '', 'publish', 'close', 'closed', '', 'example-of-lesson-text-with-video', '', '', '2025-07-23 06:23:54', '2025-07-23 06:23:54', '', 0, 'https://library.template-kits.com/educore/lesson/example-of-lesson-text-with-video/', 0, 'academy_lessons', '', 0),
