	(3890, 1, '2026-08-13 15:33:02', '2026-08-13 15:33:02', '<h2><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Overview</strong></h2><div><div data-id="e8523d1" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><div data-event-action="overview_expand" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Inter; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); font-weight: 400;">Health and social care is one of the most rewarding and impactful sectors globally, providing essential support to individuals in need and improving lives every day. With the demand for skilled professionals in health and social care growing rapidly across the world, now is the perfect time to pursue a career that makes a real difference. The global healthcare workforce shortage is expected to reach 18 million by 2030, highlighting the urgent need for qualified individuals in this vital field.</p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Inter; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); font-weight: 400;">This Health and Social Care Diploma offers a comprehensive curriculum designed to equip you with the knowledge and skills necessary to thrive in a variety of healthcare settings. You will explore key areas such as communication, rights and responsibilities, safeguarding, healthcare policies, and legal and ethical standards. Additionally, the course covers the economics of healthcare, strategic marketing, and managing finances within the sector, ensuring a well-rounded understanding of the industry.</p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Inter; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); font-weight: 400;">Completing this diploma will open up a range of career opportunities in health and social care, whether youâ€™re looking to enter the field or advance in your current role. Take the next step toward a fulfilling career that allows you to make a meaningful impact. Enrol today and be part of a global movement dedicated to improving health and well-being worldwide.</p><h2 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inter; font-weight: 700; line-height: 37px !important; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 28px !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">Learning outcomes:</h2><ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; padding: 0px; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);"><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Gain a clear understanding of the essential principles in health and social care.</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Understand communication techniques vital for effective healthcare service delivery.</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Learn the rights and responsibilities that come with being a care professional.</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Grasp the significance of safeguarding vulnerable individuals in care environments.</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Develop expertise in managing finances and service delivery in health and social care.</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Understand legal, professional, and ethical standards in health and social care practice.</span></li></ul><h2 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inter; font-weight: 700; line-height: 37px !important; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 28px !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><b style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Why Choose Academy for Health &amp; Fitness</b></h2><ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; padding: 0px; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);"><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;">Opportunity to earn certificate a certificate endorsed by the Quality Licence Scheme &amp; another accredited by CPDQS after completing the Advanced Certificate in Health and Social Care at QLS Level 3&nbsp;course</li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Get a free student ID card! (Â£10 postal charge will be applicable for international delivery)</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Innovative and engaging content.</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Get instant access to this course.</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Learn from anywhere in the world</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">This course is affordable and simple to understand</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">This course is an entirely online, interactive lesson with voiceover audio</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Free assessments</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">24/7 tutor support.</span></li></ul><h2 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inter; font-weight: 700; line-height: 37px !important; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 28px !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Who Is This Course For?</strong></h2><ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; padding: 0px; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);"><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Aspiring healthcare workers</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Current healthcare assistants</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Social care professionals</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Managers in healthcare settings</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Individuals seeking career advancement</span></li><li aria-level="1" style="box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Inter; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 0px 16px 13px 0px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.01em; list-style: none !important; padding-left: 25px; position: relative;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Those interested in health policy</span></li></ul><h2 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inter; font-weight: 700; line-height: 37px !important; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 28px !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><b style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Method Of Assessment</b></h2><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Inter; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); font-weight: 400;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">You have to complete the assignment questions given at the end of the course and score a minimum of 60% to pass the exam and to achieve Quality Licence Scheme endorsed certificates.</span></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Inter; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); font-weight: 400;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Our expert trainers will assess your assignment and give you feedback after you submit the assignment.</span></p><h2 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inter; font-weight: 700; line-height: 37px !important; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 28px !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><b style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Endorsement</b></h2><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Inter; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); font-weight: 400;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">This course has been endorsed by the Quality Licence Scheme for its high-quality, non-regulated provision and training programmes. This course is not regulated by Ofqual and is not an accredited qualification. Academy for Health &amp; Fitness will be able to advise you on any further recognition, for example progression routes into further and/or higher education. For further information please visit the Learner FAQs on the Quality Licence Scheme website.</span></p><h2 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inter; font-weight: 700; line-height: 37px !important; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 28px !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><b style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Certificate of Achievement</b></h2><h3 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inter; font-weight: 700; line-height: 34px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); margin: 30px 0px; font-size: 24px !important; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><b style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Endorsed Certificate of Achievement by the Quality Licence Scheme</b></h3><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-size: 16px !important; font-family: Inter; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(43, 53, 78); font-weight: 400;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400;">Upon successful completion of the course, learners will be eligible to order the Quality Licence Scheme-endorsed certificate (</span><b style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Advanced Certificate in Health and Social Care at QLS Level 3</b>) as proof of their achievement.</p></div></div></div><p><br></p><h3><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">CPD Certification from HF Online</strong></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">The learners have to successfully complete the assessment of this course to achieve the CPD certificates. Digital certificates can be ordered for only Â£10. The learner can purchase printed hard copies inside the UK for Â£29, and international students can purchase printed hard copies for Â£39.</span></p><h2><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Job Opportunities</strong></h2><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Healthcare Assistant</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> As a healthcare assistant, you will provide essential care and support to patients. Average Salary: Â£19,000 to Â£25,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Care Manager</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> A care manager oversees the daily operations of care homes and facilities. Average Salary: Â£26,000 to Â£40,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Social Worker</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> Social workers assist vulnerable individuals and families with various challenges. Average Salary: Â£28,000 to Â£38,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Nursing Assistant</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> Nursing assistants support registered nurses in providing patient care in hospitals. Average Salary: Â£18,000 to Â£24,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Health and Social Care Consultant</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> Consultants provide advice on improving healthcare services and organisational efficiency. Average Salary: Â£35,000 to Â£50,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Health and Safety Officer</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> A health and safety officer ensures compliance with health regulations in workplaces. Average Salary: Â£24,000 to Â£35,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Medical Administrator</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> Medical administrators handle administrative tasks in healthcare settings. Average Salary: Â£22,000 to Â£30,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Clinical Support Worker</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> Clinical support workers assist with medical tasks in hospital or clinic settings. Average Salary: Â£18,000 to Â£26,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Public Health Educator</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> Public health educators teach communities about healthy living and disease prevention. Average Salary: Â£25,000 to Â£35,000 annually.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);">Healthcare Finance Manager</strong><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 53, 78);"> A healthcare finance manager oversees the financial aspects of healthcare services. Average Salary: Â£40,000 to Â£55,000 annually.</span></li></ol>', 'Health and Social Care Level 3 Diploma - CPD Accredited', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'health-and-social-care-level-3-diploma-cpd-accredited', '', '', '2026-08-13 15:36:37', '2026-08-13 15:36:37', '', 0, 'http://localhost/poralekha/course/health-and-social-care-level-3-diploma-cpd-accredited/', 0, 'academy_courses', '', 0),
